			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740370101,
					"content": "*sigh* ...Why hasn't Edel fixed this fountain yet...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370102,
					"content": "If this doesn't get fixed soon, Keratry's going to make sure everyone in Teyvat hears about it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370103,
					"content": "Is this fountain broken?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370104,
					"content": "*sigh* Just a few days ago, it was still working just fine, but now it's suddenly stopped.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370105,
					"content": "What's worse, it broke just as I was performing magic tricks for Keratry!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370106,
					"content": "My parents were at the opera when it happened, and they told me to stay at home with my sister, and entertain her with games or books...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370107,
					"content": "But Keratry wouldn't stop pestering me to take her out. I just couldn't stop her, and ended up taking her outside to play.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370108,
					"content": "When we got to the fountain, Keratry suddenly said she wanted to wait for her parents to come out of the opera, so she could walk home with them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370109,
					"content": "That doesn't sound too bad.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370110,
					"content": "Yeah. Paimon thinks since you already walked all that way, if you waited for your parents to come out, maybe they would have treated you to something yummy!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370111,
					"content": "It was already really late by then... if Mom and Dad found out that I snuck my sister out and we were loitering around at night, they'd kill me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370112,
					"content": "So, I told a little white lie to Keratry. I told her I knew a magic trick that could make the fountain stop spraying water.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370113,
					"content": "Actually, I just knew the timing between spurts of water, and I wanted to amuse her and get her to go home.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370114,
					"content": "I correctly estimated when the fountain would stop, and my sister bought my \"magic\" spiel hook, line and sinker. She wouldn't stop badgering me to teach her how to do this \"spell\" all the way home.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370115,
					"content": "So, after I brought her home, I made up some stuff to satisfy her curiosity, and got her to go to bed before heading back to my room. Mom and Dad came home a little while later, and everything seemed normal...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370116,
					"content": "But the next day, when I was out getting the paper for dad, I realized that this fountain was still not working... It was broken!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370117,
						740370118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370117,
					"content": "Your magic is pretty powerful.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370119,
					"content": "Come on, don't tease me! If Keratry mentions this to Mom and Dad, I'm toast!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370120,
					"content": "\"Eh? The fountain at the plaza suddenly broke down? What do you think happened, dear?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370121,
					"content": "\"That's... really strange. It seemed fine before we went to the opera that night.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370122,
					"content": "\"I know why! It's because Remaudiere made it stop! Isn't that right?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370123,
						740370124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370123,
					"content": "That's a really good impression!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370125,
					"content": "And what's more, they'll find out that my sister and I were out at night, and then they'll yell at me so much, and I'll be in hot water for the next two months!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370126,
					"content": "But... this fountain should have someone managing it, right? If it's broken, can't they just call someone to fix it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370127,
					"content": "I told the fountain's manager, Edel, about this, and he promised me that he would fix it as soon as possible. But... even now, the problem hasn't been sorted out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370128,
					"content": "I can't hide it much longer, I'm finished, totally finished...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370129,
						740370130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370129,
					"content": "I'll go ask him about it for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370131
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370131,
					"content": "Really? You're willing to help? In that case, I'll give you my... my spare allowance, all of it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370132,
					"content": "Edel is over there. Please hurry up and go ask him what's going on!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370130,
					"content": "Aw, this isn't a big deal. I'll give you a hand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370131
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370124,
					"content": "Thanks to your vivid and passionate performance, I now totally understand the situation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370118,
					"content": "As expected of a mighty magician.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370133,
					"content": "As you observe the fountain, someone else arrives...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
