						],
						"pointId": 340200104
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740370801,
					"content": "This is the place. Let's get to work. This fountain has been quiet for too long. Time to get it back up and running again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edel"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370802,
					"content": "The two take to their tasks with gusto...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370803,
					"content": "The valve has been installed. I've also performed a comprehensive examination. No major issues.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Estelle"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370804,
					"content": "Alright. Then let's stand back for a moment. The only remaining task should be to open the sluice gate.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edel"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370805,
					"content": "Let me see... The main sluice is over there, and the secondary sluice will also need to be operated...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edel"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370806,
					"content": "Please wait for me here. I'm going to open the sluice gates.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edel"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370807,
					"content": "Who even designed this system? Why did they put the sluice gates so far away...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edel"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370808,
					"content": "Edel sprints over to the sluice gates with all haste and comes back after a while...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370809
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370809,
					"content": "Agh, opening them was a pain. I'm beat...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edel"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370810,
					"content": "Let's wait a moment. The water should come rushing in shortly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edel"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370811,
					"content": "After some dull rumbling sounds, the fountain resumes normal functionality...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370812
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370812,
					"content": "Awesome! The fountain is working again... Now, even if Keratry mentions what happened that night, I can pretend I don't know what she's talking about...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370813,
						740370814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370813,
					"content": "Now you know to be careful with your magic shows.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740370815,
					"content": "This isn't a problem caused by magic at all... But thanks a lot anyway. Here. This is my spare allowance — please accept it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370816,
					"content": "The payment I promised you is in there too. Thanks for your help.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370817,
					"content": "And thank you too, Edel, Ms. Estelle!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370818,
					"content": "This is as it should be — think nothing of it. Next time, don't take your little sister out in the middle of the night... Uh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Edel"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370819,
					"content": "Brother! What are you doing here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keratry"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370820,
					"content": "Keratry!? What are you doing here? Aren't you... weren't you supposed to be on a stroll with Mom and Dad?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370821,
					"content": "Hehe... I ran off while they weren't looking. I wanted to see how the fountain's doing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keratry"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370822,
					"content": "Didn't you use magic to stop this fountain? I thought it wouldn't have started flowing yet...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keratry"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370823,
					"content": "Haha... Um... Hehe... Magic has its limits. I'm sure you know that, right? It only works for a set amount of time...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370824,
					"content": "Ooh... Then I wanna see more magic! Can you make the fountain stop again!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keratry"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370825,
					"content": "This, uh... *cough* Keratry, there are lots of other people around, you know.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370826,
					"content": "If I stop it, I'll upset all the people who want to watch it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370827,
					"content": "Well... We can just come back later! And let's bring Mom and Dad too. I'm sure they'll also want to see you do magic!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keratry"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370828,
					"content": "Huh?! No, that's... Dear sister, I haven't really... fully mastered this fountain magic.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370829,
					"content": "I'm sure our parents won't want to see some lame, half-baked magic.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370830
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370830,
					"content": "That's why you can't mention my \"fountain magic\" to our parents just yet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370831,
					"content": "I want to understand it thoroughly before surprising them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370832,
					"content": "Okay! I'm sure they'll love it once you do!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370833
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Keratry"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370833,
					"content": "Yup, I'm sure they will. But let's head home first, alright? I... I can show you some new magic once we do...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Remaudiere"
				},
				{
					"id": 740370814,
					"content": "Now you know that magic and miracles all come with a price.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740370822
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}